    "odette_2_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Good. Busy is how a farm should be.",
    "odette_2_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then sit a minute. The shop will keep.",
    "odette_2_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Take these. They are going soft on the shelf.",
    "hattie_2_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Rain on the roof and a kettle on. Sit, if you like.",
    "hattie_2_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Folk talk more in the rain. I like that.",
    "rosmarin_4_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. You walk quietly. The fairy ring noticed.",
    "rosmarin_4_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Take some of the garden. It is not much, yet."
